(This specification covers hostel block construction — civil and internal electrical) Tj T*
(works complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(3.1 Exposure condition for the design of the structure shall be taken as severe in terms) Tj T*
(of IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(4.1 Plain and reinforced cement concrete works shall comply with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(4.2 Grade of concrete for all RCC members shall be M20.) Tj T*
(4.3 The nominal cover to reinforcement shall be 45 millimetre.) Tj T*
(4.4 Maximum free water-cement ratio shall be 0.45.) Tj T*
(4.5 Cement content shall be not less than 320 kg/cu.m.) Tj T*
(4.6 OPC 43 grade cement complying with IS 269:2015 shall be used.) Tj T*
(4.7 Aggregates, both coarse and fine, shall comply with IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(4.8 Fe 500D TMT reinforcement bars complying with IS 1786:2008 shall be used.) Tj T*
(4.9 Mix proportioning of concrete shall be done as per IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(4.10 Concrete shall be cured for not less than 10 days. Mechanical needle vibrators) Tj T*
(shall be used for compaction of concrete.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 5: INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(5.1 All wiring work shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
