(5.5 MCBs shall comply with IS/IEC 60898-1 and have a rated short-circuit capacity of 10) Tj T*
(kA \(rms\).) Tj T*
(5.6 MCBs from 6 ampere up to 32 ampere shall be provided as per the single line diagram.) Tj T*
(5.7 All socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs complying with IS 12640) Tj T*
(\(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(5.8 The earthing installation shall comply with IS 3043:2018.) Tj T*
(5.9 The main distribution board shall be earthed through two pipe earth electrodes.) Tj T*
(5.10 Resistance of the earthing system shall be not more than 1 ohm..) Tj T*
() Tj T*
